## Definitions

**Software** means the Android Konteiner (ANK) source code, scripts, server code, web panel assets, shell scripts, Magisk module, documentation, configuration files, and any official releases provided by the Licensor, in whole or in part.

**You** means any individual or entity exercising rights under this License.

**Distribution** means providing copies of the Software to third parties, whether for free or for compensation.

**Internal Use** means use of the Software within your own organization for your own operations, where copies of the Software are not delivered to third parties as part of any product or service.

